1
00:00:00,927 --> 00:00:02,585
Let your attention settle.

2
00:00:04,625 --> 00:00:08,015
Keep your spine straight,
your shoulders open.

3
00:00:09,454 --> 00:00:10,967
Relax your body.

4
00:00:12,929 --> 00:00:14,386
Feel your head,

5
00:00:14,835 --> 00:00:16,429
your shoulders,

6
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:18,706
your arms.

7
00:00:20,244 --> 00:00:23,304
Feel the pressure of
your body on the cushion.

8
00:00:24,890 --> 00:00:27,664
Feel your hands at their points of contact.

9
00:00:29,594 --> 00:00:33,483
Be aware of your breathing,
moment after moment.

10
00:00:34,931 --> 00:00:37,222
Notice the contact of the body:

11
00:00:37,434 --> 00:00:38,461
feet,

12
00:00:39,050 --> 00:00:39,945
back,

13
00:00:40,824 --> 00:00:42,062
hands.

14
00:00:43,599 --> 00:00:47,825
Sensations arise on their
own… and change on their own.

15
00:00:48,754 --> 00:00:51,746
Just let experience be as it is.

16
00:00:53,165 --> 00:00:54,687
Simply rest here,

17
00:00:55,077 --> 00:00:57,144
aware of
being a body,

18
00:00:57,839 --> 00:00:58,918
breathing,

19
00:00:59,805 --> 00:01:01,082
present.

20
00:01:01,894 --> 00:01:05,746
Notice if there is a quality of
awareness that is already here,

21
00:01:05,910 --> 00:01:07,910
even before you think about it.

22
00:01:09,046 --> 00:01:12,835
If you notice it, just let
your attention stay there.

23
00:01:13,145 --> 00:01:14,848
Don't try to hold it.

24
00:01:15,130 --> 00:01:16,857
Don't try to push it away.

